{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 31,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 359.3,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, make an end of my prophesying unto you, my beloved brethren.",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.01,
      "end": 7.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I cannot write but a few things,",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.605,
      "end": 10.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I know must surely come to pass;",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.386,
      "end": 13.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither can I write but a few of the words of my brother Jacob.",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.595,
      "end": 18.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the things which I have written sufficeth me,",
      "verse": "31:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.351,
      "end": 23.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be a few words which I must speak concerning the doctrine of Christ;",
      "verse": "31:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 23.268,
      "end": 28.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I shall speak unto you plainly, according to the plainness of my prophesying.",
      "verse": "31:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 29.196,
      "end": 31.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For my soul delighteth in plainness;",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.837,
      "end": 36.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after this manner doth the Lord God work among the children of men.",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.568,
      "end": 39.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord God giveth light unto the understanding;",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.952,
      "end": 45.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he speaketh unto men according to their language, unto their understanding.",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 45.973,
      "end": 51.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I would that ye should remember that I have spoken unto you concerning that prophet",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 51.586,
      "end": 53.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord showed unto me,",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.809,
      "end": 56.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that should baptize the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 56.218,
      "end": 58.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should take away the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.545,
      "end": 62.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if the Lamb of God, he being holy,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 62.836,
      "end": 65.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should have need to be baptized by water,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 65.524,
      "end": 67.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to fulfil all righteousness,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.887,
      "end": 70.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O then, how much more need have we, being unholy,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.132,
      "end": 72.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be baptized,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 72.705,
      "end": 74.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even by water!",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.01,
      "end": 77.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I would ask of you, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 78.116,
      "end": 81.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how the Lamb of God did fulfil all righteousness",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 81.547,
      "end": 83.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in being baptized by water?",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 84.085,
      "end": 85.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that he was holy?",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.076,
      "end": 88.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But notwithstanding he being holy,",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.439,
      "end": 90.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he showeth unto the children of men",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 90.987,
      "end": 92.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that, according to the flesh",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 93.025,
      "end": 95.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he humbleth himself before the Father,",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 95.527,
      "end": 97.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and witnesseth unto the Father",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 97.75,
      "end": 101.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would be obedient unto him in keeping his commandments.",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 102.47,
      "end": 105.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, after he was baptized with water",
      "verse": "31:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 105.39,
      "end": 108.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Holy Ghost descended upon him in the form of a dove.",
      "verse": "31:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 109.507,
      "end": 115.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, it showeth unto the children of men the straitness of the path,",
      "verse": "31:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 115.353,
      "end": 118.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the narrowness of the gate, by which they should enter,",
      "verse": "31:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 119.062,
      "end": 121.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he having set the example before them.",
      "verse": "31:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 122.064,
      "end": 124.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto the children of men:",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 124.52,
      "end": 125.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Follow thou me.",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 125.954,
      "end": 127.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 128.084,
      "end": 132.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "can we follow Jesus save we shall be willing to keep the commandments of the Father?",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 133.315,
      "end": 134.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Father said:",
      "verse": "31:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 135.028,
      "end": 136.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Repent ye, repent ye,",
      "verse": "31:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 137.112,
      "end": 140.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be baptized in the name of my Beloved Son.",
      "verse": "31:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 140.764,
      "end": 143.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, the voice of the Son came unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 143.87,
      "end": 146.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He that is baptized in my name,",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 146.186,
      "end": 149.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to him will the Father give the Holy Ghost, like unto me;",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 149.942,
      "end": 151.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, follow me,",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 151.84,
      "end": 154.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do the things which ye have seen me do.",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 154.981,
      "end": 156.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 157.111,
      "end": 161.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know that if ye shall follow the Son, with full purpose of heart,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 161.471,
      "end": 165.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "acting no hypocrisy and no deception before God,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 165.32,
      "end": 166.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but with real intent,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 167.125,
      "end": 168.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "repenting of your sins,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 169.07,
      "end": 175.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "witnessing unto the Father that ye are willing to take upon you the name of Christ, by baptism\u2014",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 175.287,
      "end": 179.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by following your Lord and your Savior down into the water, according to his word,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 180.111,
      "end": 182.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, then shall ye receive the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 182.892,
      "end": 186.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, then cometh the baptism of fire and of the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 186.88,
      "end": 189.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then can ye speak with the tongue of angels,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 189.846,
      "end": 192.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shout praises unto the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 193.545,
      "end": 195.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 196.093,
      "end": 199.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus came the voice of the Son unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 199.199,
      "end": 201.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "After ye have repented of your sins,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 201.747,
      "end": 208.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and witnessed unto the Father that ye are willing to keep my commandments, by the baptism of water,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 208.8,
      "end": 212.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have received the baptism of fire and of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 212.788,
      "end": 214.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and can speak with a new tongue,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 215.104,
      "end": 217.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even with the tongue of angels,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 217.652,
      "end": 219.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after this should deny me,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 219.875,
      "end": 223.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it would have been better for you that ye had not known me.",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 223.945,
      "end": 226.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I heard a voice from the Father, saying:",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 226.679,
      "end": 229.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, the words of my Beloved are true and faithful.",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 230.017,
      "end": 231.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "He that endureth to the end,",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 232.147,
      "end": 233.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same shall be saved.",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 234.499,
      "end": 236.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 236.722,
      "end": 242.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know by this that unless a man shall endure to the end, in following the example of the Son of the living God,",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 243.032,
      "end": 244.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he cannot be saved.",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 245.291,
      "end": 248.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, do the things which I have told you",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 249.0,
      "end": 252.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have seen that your Lord and your Redeemer should do;",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 252.245,
      "end": 255.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, for this cause have they been shown unto me,",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 255.397,
      "end": 258.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might know the gate by which ye should enter.",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 258.967,
      "end": 263.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the gate by which ye should enter is repentance and baptism by water;",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 263.884,
      "end": 268.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then cometh a remission of your sins by fire and by the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 269.44,
      "end": 274.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then are ye in this strait and narrow path which leads to eternal life;",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 274.31,
      "end": 276.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye have entered in by the gate;",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 276.905,
      "end": 280.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have done according to the commandments of the Father and the Son;",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 280.568,
      "end": 282.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye have received the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 282.791,
      "end": 285.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which witnesses of the Father and the Son,",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 285.525,
      "end": 288.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto the fulfilling of the promise which he hath made,",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 288.631,
      "end": 291.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye entered in by the way ye should receive.",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 292.562,
      "end": 294.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 294.785,
      "end": 298.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after ye have gotten into this strait and narrow path,",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 298.216,
      "end": 300.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would ask if all is done?",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 300.207,
      "end": 301.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, Nay;",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 302.152,
      "end": 304.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye have not come thus far",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 304.329,
      "end": 308.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were by the word of Christ with unshaken faith in him,",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 308.642,
      "end": 312.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "relying wholly upon the merits of him who is mighty to save.",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 313.177,
      "end": 317.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, ye must press forward with a steadfastness in Christ,",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 317.629,
      "end": 320.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having a perfect brightness of hope,",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 320.224,
      "end": 322.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a love of God and of all men.",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 322.865,
      "end": 325.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if ye shall press forward,",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 325.831,
      "end": 328.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "feasting upon the word of Christ,",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 328.333,
      "end": 329.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and endure to the end,",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 330.092,
      "end": 332.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, thus saith the Father:",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 332.501,
      "end": 334.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye shall have eternal life.",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 335.039,
      "end": 337.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "31:21",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 337.541,
      "end": 338.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "this is the way;",
      "verse": "31:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 339.068,
      "end": 343.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is none other way nor name given under heaven",
      "verse": "31:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 343.428,
